Here is a complete, single-file web application for designing parametric 3D-printable lampshades. It uses Three.js for real-time 3D procedural geometry generation and includes a built-in Binary STL Exporter so you can take your designs straight to your slicer (Cura, PrusaSlicer, Bambu Studio, etc.).
How to Run the App
 * Save the code below as lampshade-studio.html on your computer.
 * Double-click the file to open it in any modern web browser (no local server or installation required).
